{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816100-line","text":"你走在一片光秃秃的废墟上，粒子湮灭虫在星际能源战争中将这里啃得一干二净，连土壤和岩石都不剩下的苍白地表，只有一台孤零零的自动售货机。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816101-line","text":"售货机骄傲地履行着它的职责，直到你的到来，打破了不用上班的美好时光。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816102-line","text":"「逻辑：本机仍处于战时管理模式，请证明您拥有比战争另一方更高的投资价值，以及更高的获胜几率。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816103-line","text":"「基于您的投资价值，本机将评估对您的服务标准。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816104-line","text":"「否则，本机有理由判断，对您的支援无法使公司利益最大化，并拒绝您的消费要求——哔嘟，即将开始对您进行战斗力检定。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-8177723585964728621-choice","text":"让它看看你有多强。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-7169578995339613894-effect","text":"只有胜利者才值得投资。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816107-line","text":"「哔嘟，检定已开始，请勿离开检测范围。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-1391645279459064646-choice","text":"你最好再想想。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-4235411751154757136-effect","text":"展示你绝强的战力。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-5251639576603744540-choice","text":"售货机吐出了商品。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816111-line","text":"售货机沉默不语，你第一次知道，原来机器也会欺软怕硬。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-5876834895149178741-choice","text":"这个够了吗？","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-2276748929968860144-effect","text":"展示你普通的战力。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-6102883409381177105-choice","text":"售货机亮出了折扣。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816112-line","text":"事实证明，拳头是宇宙的通用货币。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-9057529563354635015-choice","text":"太贵了。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-17240493615890863073-effect","text":"你选择离开。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816113-line","text":"总有一天，你要它求着你买它的东西。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-8321860741396426310-choice","text":"给我个面子。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-12502152578273360544-effect","text":"展示你羸弱的战力。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-3744508743801429003-choice","text":"售货机亮出了售价。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816114-line","text":"贵有贵的好处，你如此安慰自己。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-15274465420717662453-choice","text":"我要免费的！","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816115-line","text":"「基于归属权问题，任何威胁本机的行为，都将视作对星际和平公司的宣战——战斗模式启动。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-9718097720253049354-choice","text":"打不过，溜了溜了。","speaker":""}]}
